# Browser tool scratch. Playwright MCP writes its profile and traces here,
# and screenshots taken at the repo root land beside the site's own files.
# Both are counted by the skill's canonical "shipped weight" command, so a
# cycle that forgets to clear them reads as a site that grew tens of MB.
/.playwright-mcp/
